{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay wave after wave of sinister creatures in <strong>Shadow Quest</strong>, a fast\u2011paced action roguelite where timing, skill combos, and smart decisions are your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Core Mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/df7fcc00590f4bba09ca05386a606ac0.poster.avif?t=1753796992\" aria-label=\"Demonstrate hit and run core mechanics\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/df7fcc00590f4bba09ca05386a606ac0.webm?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/df7fcc00590f4bba09ca05386a606ac0.mp4?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hit &amp; Run Combat</strong> \u2013 Fire rapid\u2011cast spells, dodge incoming attacks, and reposition yourself to control the fight flow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/96e566da07a0b8b76c448da9848842ee.poster.avif?t=1753796992\" aria-label=\"Demonstrate building skills for the mage class character\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/96e566da07a0b8b76c448da9848842ee.webm?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/96e566da07a0b8b76c448da9848842ee.mp4?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mage\u2011only Build System</strong> \u2013 Shape your mage through <strong>horizontal progression</strong>: no XP grinding! Choose from unique spells, enabling deep, customizable playstyles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/695a40d4020c8bed9c527fd1cb6eeb28.poster.avif?t=1753796992\" aria-label=\"Demonstrate upgrading shrine to access higher quality of skills\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/695a40d4020c8bed9c527fd1cb6eeb28.webm?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/695a40d4020c8bed9c527fd1cb6eeb28.mp4?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Skill Shrine</strong> \u2013 Players can <strong>invest Gold and Gems\u00a0</strong>into the shrine to enhance its quality and increase the odds of accessing higher-tier skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Run\u2011based Progression</strong><br>Each playthrough drops you into  rooms with unique enemies, traps, and treasures. Between rooms, strategic choices await\u2014will you brave the next battle or invest your hard-earned gold or gems into skill mastery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u26a1 Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize builds on the fly: Do you trade mobility for raw damage?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic Resource Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance your resources:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immediate purchase</strong> of mid-tier skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investing in a statue</strong> to unlock higher-quality options later</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This macro-level layer enriches your growth decisions with <strong>delayed gratification tension</strong>.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820380?t=1753796992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/4a4b4de5d7fb93d61a86e36c5032352c4f3a3a77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753796992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/e0be8af510072972167dfe22443514d63edcc0f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753796992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/e0be8af510072972167dfe22443514d63edcc0f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753796992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay wave after wave of sinister creatures in <strong>Shadow Quest</strong>, a fast\u2011paced action roguelite where timing, skill combos, and smart decisions are your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Core Mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/df7fcc00590f4bba09ca05386a606ac0.poster.avif?t=1753796992\" aria-label=\"Demonstrate hit and run core mechanics\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820380/extras/df7fcc00590f4bba09ca05386a606ac0.webm?t=1753796992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share